Z||000012||ChadMan||03-02-2000||04:33 PM||||My entry for "Strangest Cargo Ever Hauled in a Fiero":<P>The guy I sold my 84 to said he took it deer hunting.  He said a quartered deer fit in the trunk.  I didn't ask him if he put anything down to protect the trunk carpet.  The thought of bloody deer parts in the same trunk I once painstakingly vacuumed made me sick.||||reg||9
